WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.770
I was looking for a new robot vacuum
cleaner before I had another one that

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.080
offered a subscription service.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.880
Um, I started browsing around.
I saw some reviews for eufy,

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.190
you know, they were pretty good, and they
had the option to be able to kind of

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.770
lease it through or, you know, subscribe,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.470
have a subscription through
Whim, and I thought,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.540
"Oh, this is perfect." I
didn't think any other,

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:25.370
you know, manufacturer or, you know,
other product like this had this kind of

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.890
option available. The
robot that I had before,

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.980
they actually discontinued the service,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.700
um, and wasn't offering it anymore,
but I was kind of just like a legacy

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.590
customer, and I kind of left just
because of it wasn't a good experience.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.500
But nonetheless, like, eufy's been great.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.770
It's been great so far.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.770
Um,

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.710
I'm interested, you know,
just to see, you know,

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.000
how this is gonna work. I think for me,

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.900
the not having the full commitments of,

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.100
you know, maybe, you know,
putting down so much money for,

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.680
like, a large purchase like this,
especially when technology changes so much

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.980
and, you know, these
machines get upgraded.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:01.230
And so I would rather be in a situation
where I could subscribe to it and then

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.030
have access to being able to possibly,

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.540
like, upgrade or change my machine if
something else comes out better with

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.960
more features or better features.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.170
So that's kind of, you
know, the reason why, um,

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:13.030
I think subscription is the best way
to go rather than just committing to

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:17.150
paying a flat fee for it and being
stuck with an aging [chuckles] machine,

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.200
so to speak. So,

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.970
um, but yeah, that's it. But it's
been a great experience so far,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:24.240
so looking forward to seeing, you know,
how it's going to be in the future and

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:27.630
hopefully being able to upgrade
or to switch over to other,

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.960
you know, eufy products
as my needs change.
